              "translation": "Learned / Studied",
              "tags": [
                "S3",
                "past"
              ],
              "example": {
                "term": "ഇന്ന് ഇരുപത് പുതിയ വാക്കുകൾ പഠിച്ചു.",
                "translation": "Learned twenty new words today."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ml_s3_orma",
              "term": "ഓർമ്മ",
              "transliteration": "Ormma",
              "translation": "Memory",
              "tags": [
                "S3",
                "noun"
              ],
              "example": {
                "term": "കുട്ടിക്കാലത്തെ നല്ല ഓർമ്മകൾ.",
                "translation": "Fond childhood memories."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ml_s3_anubhavam",
              "term": "അനുഭവം",
              "transliteration": "Anubhavam",
              "translation": "Experience",
              "tags": [
                "S3",
                "noun"
              ],
              "example": {
                "term": "ഇതൊരു പുതിയ അനുഭവമായിരുന്നു.",
                "translation": "This was a new experience."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ml_s3_kazhinja",
              "term": "കഴിഞ്ഞ",
              "transliteration": "Kazhinja",
              "translation": "Last / Past",
              "tags": [
                "S3",
                "time"
              ],
              "example": {
                "term": "കഴിഞ്ഞ ആഴ്ച പ്രോജക്റ്റ് തുടങ്ങി.",
                "translation": "Started the project last week."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ml-s3-u2-l2",
          "title": "Plans & Decisions",
          "objective": "Talk about upcoming intentions and decisions.",
          "grammarNote": "Attach '-ആൻ ഉദ്ദേശിക്കുന്നു' (-aan uddeshikkunnu) to a verb for 'intend to...'.",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "ml_s3_theerumanam",
